/* book Worked example: Q: A QPSK modem sends 10 Mb/s with rectangular pulses and Gray labels at Eb/N0 = 10 dB. Find (a) the symbol rate, (b) the null-to-null bandwidth, (c) the bandwidth efficiency, (d) Pb and Ps.
   1. k = 2, so Rs = Rb/2 = 5 Msymbol/s and Ts = 0.2 µs.
   2. B = 2Rs = 10 MHz.
   3. Rb/B = 10/10 = 1 b/s/Hz (= k/2).
   4. Eb/N0 = 10; Pb = Q(√20) = Q(4.472) = 3.87 × 10−6.
   5. Ps = 2Pb − Pb² = 7.74 × 10−6.
   Answer: Rs = 5 Msymbol/s, B = 10 MHz, 1 b/s/Hz, Pb = 3.87 × 10−6, Ps = 7.74 × 10−6. */
